{"seq":4,"slug":"social-interaction","title":"社会行为与互动","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction","rating":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 社会行为与互动 简介\n\n社会行为与互动是社会学的核心研究领域之一，它关注人们在日常生活中如何相互影响、建立联结并维持社会秩序。从婴儿学会说第一个词的那一刻起，个体就被卷入了一个由符号、规范和角色构成的互动世界。本系列系统梳理社会互动的主要理论视角与经验发现，帮助读者理解那些看似自然而然的社会行为背后隐藏的深层结构与运作机制。\n\n本系列适合对人际互动与社会秩序感兴趣的中高级知识工作者，尤其适合希望从社会学视角理解团队协作、组织文化和群体行为的程序员与技术管理者。你不需要社会学专业背景，但需要具备对\"人如何在社会中行动\"这一命题的探究热情。\n\n全书共分五章，从个体的社会化过程出发，逐步展开到微观互动理论、群体行为、社会控制机制，最终落脚于日常生活中的规范与秩序。\n\n第1章**社会化与身份认同**探讨个体如何从一个生物性的存在成长为一个社会性的存在。从初级社会化到再社会化，从自我建构到角色表演，本章揭示了社会如何将文化规范内化于每一个成员之中。\n\n第2章**符号互动论**深入社会学中最具微观洞察力的理论传统，依次呈现米德的自我理论、戈夫曼的拟剧论、标签理论以及常人方法学，展示社会秩序如何在面对面的互动中被持续建构。\n\n第3章**群体动力学与集体行为**将分析视角从二人互动扩展到群体层面，考察小群体中的权力与凝聚力、集体行动的逻辑、社会网络的结构效应以及科层组织的运行特征。\n\n第4章**越轨与社会控制**探讨社会如何界定和回应偏离规范的行为。从越轨行为的多元理论解释，到正式与非正式的社会控制机制，再到道德恐慌与监控社会，本章揭示了规范与权力之间的深层关联。\n\n第5章**社会规范与从众**回到日常互动的微观世界，分析规范如何形成与维持、从众与服从的心理社会机制、信任与社会资本的运作逻辑，以及互动仪式如何在重复的日常实践中再生产社会秩序。\n\n推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。第1章为理解所有后续内容提供了\"个体如何成为社会人\"的基础框架，第2章的理论工具贯穿全书各章的分析，第3至5章则从群体、控制和规范三个维度展开社会互动的全景图。如果你时间有限，建议优先阅读第1章和第2章，它们覆盖了社会互动研究最核心的概念与理论。对组织管理与权力结构感兴趣的读者，可以将第3章和第4章作为重点深入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialization-identity","title":"社会化与身份认同","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/socialization-identity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"primary-secondary-socialization","title":"初级社会化与次级社会化","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/socialization-identity/primary-secondary-socialization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-formation-self","title":"身份认同与自我建构","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/socialization-identity/identity-formation-self"},{"seq":3,"slug":"role-theory-performance","title":"角色理论与角色表演","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/socialization-identity/role-theory-performance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"resocialization-total-institutions","title":"再社会化与全控机构","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/socialization-identity/resocialization-total-institutions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"symbolic-interactionism","title":"符号互动论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/symbolic-interactionism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mead-self-society","title":"米德与自我、心灵、社会","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/symbolic-interactionism/mead-self-society"},{"seq":2,"slug":"goffman-dramaturgy","title":"戈夫曼与拟剧论","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/symbolic-interactionism/goffman-dramaturgy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"labeling-theory","title":"标签理论","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/symbolic-interactionism/labeling-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ethnomethodology","title":"常人方法学","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/symbolic-interactionism/ethnomethodology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"group-collective-behavior","title":"群体动力学与集体行为","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/group-collective-behavior","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"small-group-dynamics","title":"小群体动力学","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/group-collective-behavior/small-group-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crowd-behavior-collective-action","title":"集群行为与集体行动","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/group-collective-behavior/crowd-behavior-collective-action"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-networks-analysis","title":"社会网络分析","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/group-collective-behavior/social-networks-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"organizations-bureaucracy","title":"组织与科层制","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/group-collective-behavior/organizations-bureaucracy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"deviance-social-control","title":"越轨与社会控制","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/deviance-social-control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deviance-theories","title":"越轨行为的理论解释","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/deviance-social-control/deviance-theories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-control-mechanisms","title":"社会控制的机制","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/deviance-social-control/social-control-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-panics-stigma","title":"道德恐慌与污名化","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/deviance-social-control/moral-panics-stigma"},{"seq":4,"slug":"surveillance-discipline","title":"监控与规训社会","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/deviance-social-control/surveillance-discipline"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"norms-conformity","title":"社会规范与从众","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/norms-conformity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-norms-formation","title":"社会规范的形成与维持","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/norms-conformity/social-norms-formation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conformity-obedience","title":"从众与服从","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/norms-conformity/conformity-obedience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trust-social-capital","title":"信任与社会资本","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/norms-conformity/trust-social-capital"},{"seq":4,"slug":"everyday-interaction-rituals","title":"日常互动仪式","url":"/h/sociology/social-interaction/norms-conformity/everyday-interaction-rituals"}]}]}